  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_4859.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(10 fotos) Se han sorteado cinco premios m&aacute;s de 200 euros, cuyas agraciadas se pueden ver tambi&eacute;n en la foto adjunta. Las tarjetas regalo de Onda Centre Comercial y Caja Rural se entregar&aacute;n el lunes 10 de diciembre, a las 20.30 horas, en un acto en la Casa de Cultura.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4844.jpg\" alt=\"img_4844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4845.jpg\" alt=\"img_4845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4846.jpg\" alt=\"img_4846\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4848.jpg\" alt=\"img_4848\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4849.jpg\" alt=\"img_4849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4850.jpg\" alt=\"img_4850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4854.jpg\" alt=\"img_4854\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4855.jpg\" alt=\"img_4855\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigocccompraraondatepremis/img_4856.jpg\" alt=\"img_4856\" sty